# Read for `pnpm build sepolia` (and CI with the repo variable DEPLOY_ENV=sepolia).
# A value set in the environment wins, so a repo variable overrides any of these.
#
# The app's own RPC, so the board and the lobby can be read before a wallet is
# connected (a judge looking without one). A public node; set PUBLIC_NODE_URL
# as a repo variable to use a better one. Sepolia is known to every wallet, so
# PUBLIC_CHAIN_INFO_NODE_URL is not needed.
PUBLIC_NODE_URL="https://ethereum-sepolia.publicnode.com"
# The hosted reveal scheduler, so a player who closes the tab still reveals.
# It has sepolia configured (`/api/time/11155111` answers) and accepts what
# @fuzd/client 0.12 sends. Scheduling also needs the chain's
# `expectedWorstGasPrice`, set in contracts/rocketh/config.ts.
PUBLIC_FUZD_URI="https://api.fuzd.dev"
